cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
title: "Renewable- and Thermal-Aware Hierarchical MARL Workflow Scheduler"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Ansari
    given-names: Mohammad Sepehr
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
abstract: >
  Reproduction and extension of the hierarchical multi-agent actor-critic framework of
  Jayanetti et al. (IEEE TPDS 2024) for renewable-energy-aware workflow scheduling across
  geo-distributed cloud data centers, with real PVGIS solar data, Alibaba-trace workloads
  and a rack-level thermal-awareness extension.
